                                "sense_id": "617c872a-72c4-388b-bf45-6aa5755e5906",
                                "text": "The teacher told Martha that she had invited a neighboring planter to send his children to her school, but \"he said 'Me & my wife had no eddication, nor any of my gals, but I would rather they never would have any, than go to school with niggers.' So he had his druther!\"⁴⁸"
